  {
   "sha": "2fee0dfeefcd1c6b0a1734d4acd440b6c1073acf",
   "html_url": "https://github.com/SebR214/margin/commit/2fee0dfeefcd1c6b0a1734d4acd440b6c1073acf",
   "date": "2026-11-03T13:09:58Z",
   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-436: collect checks out the tip of main, and the claims audit runs after the routes files (#783)\n\n* SEB-436: collect checks out the tip of main, and the claims audit runs after the routes files\n\nSince #779 a chain link is dispatched ~30 min before it collects. actions/checkout defaults to github.sha, frozen at\ndispatch, so every other link collected on a main from before the previous link's commit and its Commit samples rebase\nconflicted on every data file (3 Nov 10:05, 11:05 UTC failed; build skipped). checkout now takes ref: main.\n\nThe claims audit ran before emit_routes.py, so routeData.bigCaption compared this hour's raw rows with last hour's\nroutes_summary.json: false on every first run of an hour. With every other run failing, only false rows landed and the\nwatchdog emailed at 12:30 UTC. Moved after the routes emitters, before the bake that reads claims_status.json.\nChecked locally: bigCaption ok, differ [].\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVGgsNosa4c5zdXbTMr\n\n* SEB-436: movers self-test takes as many movers as qualify, so a gap a week ago does not fail the run\n\n27 Oct 10-13 UTC has no figures, so on 3 Nov at those hours no country has a weekly change. The self-test demanded 8,\nfailed the hourly step and the checks job, and so blocked every merge to main.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVGgsNosa4c5zdXbTMr\n\n* SEB-436: movers ranks run 1..n for however many qualify\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVGgsNosa4c5zdXbTMr\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
